</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><th scope="row">Diagnosis</th><td>Kevin reads your public store and ads plus your five answers. With view access, he reads the ad and store accounts.</td><td>Answer five questions. Give view-only access for the deeper read.</td>
</tr>
<tr><th scope="row">Plan</th><td>One plan across ads, pages, retention and automation, in order, scoped to what your numbers need.</td><td>Decide what to do and who does it. The roadmap is yours either way.</td>
</tr>
<tr><th scope="row">Ads</th><td>Build, check and adjust campaigns on Meta, Google, Bing and TikTok, judged against store sales.</td><td>Approve offers and budgets.</td>
</tr>
