</tr>
<tr><th scope="row">Reporting</th><td>A weekly plain-English read: what moved, why, and the next three moves.</td><td>Read it and reply with questions.</td>
</tr>
<tr><th scope="row">Approvals</th><td>Changes to your accounts wait for your say-so.</td><td>Give a yes or no.</td>
</tr>
